                  "fill": "#e9e9e9",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                  "width": 742.56,
                  "height": 84,
                  "content": "pond stores data locally by default ($XDG_DATA_HOME/pond). To use an S3-compatible bucket (Hetzner, R2, B2, MinIO, AWS): add credentials, probe, copy, switch. Your local data is never modified - it stays as a backup.",
