                              "name": "Idempotent union merge: re-runnable, res",
                              "context": "p",
                              "fill": "#e9e9e9",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 84,
                              "content": "Idempotent union merge: re-runnable, resumable, never touches the source. Rebuilds destination indexes and verifies every row landed - exit 0 synced, 6 if rows are missing (re-run; it converges) or duplicated.",
