                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "height": 156,
                                          "content": "claude-code: classify fallback blocks as injected and document blocks as files (#364) (67592c3) pond now stores Claude Code model-fallback markers as harness content, so they no longer show up as assistant text in search, stores PDF attachments as files, and records the media type of PDF and image attachments. Sessions ingested earlier keep the old classification.",
