                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "height": 136,
                                          "content": "schedule: keep systemd sync timers recurring (#352) (a66b2b7) Systemd sync schedules now keep firing and catch up missed runs after restart, with a stable per-host delay to spread shared-store load. Re-run pond schedule start --every <interval> after upgrading. Daily schedules start from 03:00 local time and follow calendar days.",
